            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The method of exposure to external pain was used in 143 patients. It was shown to be highly efficient in treatment of a number of functional diseases. The authors emphasize the importance of further multilateral investigation of prospects of using this method in medicine.</AbstractText>
